{"resource":{"id":"figma-sample-exercises","title":"Figma — Sample Exercises","category":"Design","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"17 min","pages":33,"lastUpdated":"January 2026","tags":["Figma","Design Systems","Design"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1609921212029-bb5a28e60960?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"300+ practical Figma exercises covering frames, Auto Layout, constraints, responsive layouts, components, variants, design systems, typography, grids, prototyping, Smart Animate, accessibility, Dev Mode, plugins, and collaboration."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"toc","label":"Table of Contents"},{"id":"intro","label":"Introduction"},{"id":"content","label":"Detailed Content"},{"id":"ui","label":"UI Design Examples"},{"id":"diagrams","label":"Workflow & Component Diagrams"},{"id":"examples","label":"Real-world Examples"},{"id":"practices","label":"Best Practices"},{"id":"mistakes","label":"Common Mistakes"},{"id":"tips","label":"Tips & Tricks"},{"id":"compare","label":"Comparison Table"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary & Key Takeaways"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQs"},{"id":"references","label":"Further Reading & References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"Figma — Complete Tutorial","tag":"Design","time":"43 min"},{"title":"Figma — Cheat Sheet","tag":"Design","time":"4 min"},{"title":"Figma — Interview Questions","tag":"Design","time":"29 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Understand the concepts covered in Figma — Sample Exercises.</li>\n          <li>Build production-ready UI using Auto Layout, components, and variants.</li>\n          <li>Design responsive interfaces and scalable design systems.</li>\n          <li>Prototype interactions with Smart Animate and interactive components.</li>\n          <li>Collaborate effectively with developers using Dev Mode.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"toc\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Table of Contents</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ol class=\"list-decimal space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n          <li>Introduction & Context</li>\n          <li>Detailed Educational Content</li>\n          <li>UI Design Examples</li>\n          <li>Workflow & Component Diagrams</li>\n          <li>Real-world Examples & Applications</li>\n          <li>Best Practices & Common Mistakes</li>\n          <li>Tips, Comparisons & Summary</li>\n          <li>FAQs, References & Disclaimer</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"intro\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Introduction</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>300+ practical Figma exercises covering frames, Auto Layout, constraints, responsive layouts, components, variants, design systems, typography, grids, prototyping, Smart Animate, accessibility, Dev Mode, plugins, and collaboration.</p>\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-sky-500/40 bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-900 dark:text-sky-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"/><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Who this is for</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">Product designers, UI/UX designers, and developers who want to master Figma for shipping polished, accessible interfaces.</div></div></div></div>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558655146-9f40138edfeb?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 — Figma workspace: layers panel, canvas, and inspector for design systems.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"content\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Detailed Educational Content</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Figma is a collaborative interface design tool used by product teams to design, prototype, and hand off UIs. This <b>Sample Exercises</b> walks through the concepts you need most.</p>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><b>Frames & Pages</b> — organize screens and flows within a single file.</li>\n          <li><b>Auto Layout</b> — flex-like layout with padding, gaps, and resizing modes.</li>\n          <li><b>Components & Variants</b> — reusable primitives that scale across teams.</li>\n          <li><b>Variables & Styles</b> — design tokens for color, spacing, and typography.</li>\n          <li><b>Prototyping</b> — flows, overlays, Smart Animate, and interactive components.</li>\n          <li><b>Dev Mode</b> — inspect, measure, and export developer-ready specs.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"ui\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">UI Design Examples</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>// Auto Layout starter — button component\nFrame &quot;Button/Primary&quot;\n  Auto Layout: horizontal, gap 8, padding 12x20\n  Fill: token.color.primary\n  Radius: token.radius.md\n  Children:\n    Icon 16x16 (optional)\n    Text &quot;Label&quot; — token.text.button\nVariants: state = {default, hover, pressed, disabled}, size = {sm, md, lg}</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"diagrams\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Workflow &amp; Component Diagrams</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611162617213-7d7a39e9b1d7?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 — Design system architecture: tokens → primitives → patterns → screens.\" />\n        <pre class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-border/60 bg-muted/40 p-4 text-xs leading-relaxed\">\nResearch\n  │\n  ▼\nWireframes ──► Low-fi mockups ──► High-fi UI\n                                       │\n                                       ▼\n                            Auto Layout + Components\n                                       │\n                                       ▼\n                            Variables + Design System\n                                       │\n                                       ▼\n                            Prototype ──► Usability test\n                                       │\n                                       ▼\n                            Dev Mode ──► Developer Handoff\n        </pre>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"examples\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Real-world Examples</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><b>Uber</b> — Base design system built and maintained in Figma.</li>\n          <li><b>Microsoft</b> — Fluent 2 shipped as a Figma library across product teams.</li>\n          <li><b>GitHub</b> — Primer design system components published as Figma libraries.</li>\n          <li><b>Shopify</b> — Polaris tokens synced between Figma and code.</li>\n          <li><b>Airbnb</b> — Cross-platform design language authored in Figma.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"practices\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Best Practices</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Use Auto Layout on every reusable component — never fixed-size frames.</li>\n          <li>Name layers and components consistently: <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>Category/Name/Variant</code></pre></div>.</li>\n          <li>Adopt variables/tokens for color, spacing, radius, and typography.</li>\n          <li>Design mobile-first; add breakpoints with resizing constraints.</li>\n          <li>Publish shared libraries; version releases via branching.</li>\n          <li>Design for accessibility: contrast, focus states, and touch targets.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"mistakes\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Common Mistakes</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Detaching components instead of creating variants or properties.</li>\n          <li>Hard-coded colors and spacing that bypass tokens.</li>\n          <li>Broken Auto Layout because children have absolute positioning.</li>\n          <li>Prototype flows that break when frames are renamed or duplicated.</li>\n          <li>Unlabeled interactive elements — hostile to screen readers.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"tips\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Tips &amp; Tricks</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>Shift + A</code></pre></div> wraps a selection in Auto Layout.</li>\n          <li><div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>Alt/Option + drag</code></pre></div> duplicates instantly; hold <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>Shift</code></pre></div> to constrain.</li>\n          <li>Use component properties (boolean, text, instance swap) instead of many variants.</li>\n          <li>Smart Animate matching layer names creates seamless transitions.</li>\n          <li>Use Dev Mode's <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>Inspect</code></pre></div> for CSS, iOS, and Android snippets.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"compare\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Comparison Table</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n          <table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr class=\"border-b border-border/60 text-left\">\n                <th class=\"py-2 pr-4\">Feature</th>\n                <th class=\"py-2 pr-4\">Figma</th>\n                <th class=\"py-2 pr-4\">Sketch</th>\n                <th class=\"py-2\">Adobe XD</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody class=\"[&>tr]:border-b [&>tr]:border-border/40\">\n              <tr><td class=\"py-2 pr-4\">Realtime collaboration</td><td>Native</td><td>Plugin</td><td>Limited</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"py-2 pr-4\">Auto Layout</td><td>Advanced</td><td>Basic</td><td>Basic</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"py-2 pr-4\">Variables & tokens</td><td>Yes</td><td>Limited</td><td>No</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"py-2 pr-4\">Dev handoff</td><td>Dev Mode</td><td>Inspect</td><td>Share link</td></tr>\n              <tr><td class=\"py-2 pr-4\">Platforms</td><td>Web + desktop</td><td>macOS only</td><td>Discontinued</td></tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Figma unifies design, prototyping, and developer handoff in one tool.</li>\n          <li>Auto Layout + components + variables are the foundation of scalable UI.</li>\n          <li>Design systems are the leverage that makes teams ship faster.</li>\n          <li>Accessibility and responsive design are non-negotiable defaults.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQs</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Is Figma free?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Figma has a generous free tier for individuals and small teams; paid plans unlock unlimited files and advanced features.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Do I need a design background?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">No — beginners can start with the interface tour and grow through structured practice.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Figma vs Sketch vs XD?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Figma leads on collaboration, cross-platform support, and Auto Layout maturity.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>What is Dev Mode?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">A dedicated inspector for developers to read specs, tokens, and code snippets from the design file.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Further Reading &amp; References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"https://help.figma.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Figma Help Center — official docs</a></li>\n          <li><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"https://www.figma.com/best-practices/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Figma Best Practices</a></li>\n          <li><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"https://www.figma.com/community\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Figma Community — free files & plugins</a></li>\n          <li><a class=\"text-primary hover:underline\" href=\"https://www.designsystems.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">DesignSystems.com — patterns & articles</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">This resource is educational and reflects widely accepted Figma workflows as of the last updated date. Interfaces and features change; always verify against the latest official Figma documentation.</p>\n      </div></section>"}